WEBVTT

00:09:58.500 --> 00:10:00.786
She worked more.

00:10:00.810 --> 00:10:03.486
She started a local chapter
of a mentoring program

00:10:03.510 --> 00:10:06.905
and spent her weekends tutoring
low-income, high-achieving students.

00:10:07.343 --> 00:10:10.796
CC: You know, it was really fun, actually.

00:10:10.820 --> 00:10:15.023
AG: You are an overworked,
emotionally-exhausted teacher,

00:10:15.920 --> 00:10:20.491
and your idea of self-care is to then say,

00:10:20.491 --> 00:10:24.130
"Alright, I'm going to start another 
organization and volunteer for it."

00:10:24.130 --> 00:10:27.116
What kind of sick
and twisted vacation is that?

00:10:27.140 --> 00:10:29.576
CC: I know it sounds counterintuitive,

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:31.926
but I felt really refreshed,